The page reads XZ Utils as the same handover route, taken again. The four topics are the page's related defense topics.
notes:
The page names one related kill chain, XZ Utils, and four defense topics.

XZ Utils is where, in the page's words, the same route was taken again, far more patiently, with sock puppets manufacturing the pressure that made handover feel necessary. Its own kill chain covers that incident in full.

The page's related defense topics are CI/CD and supply chain, Git and version control, vulnerability management, and threat modeling. CI/CD stands for continuous integration and continuous delivery.
